<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PREPARACIÓN APTIS</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2c3e50;
            --secondary: #3498db;
            --success: #27ae60;
            --error: #e74c3c;
            --bg: #f4f7f6;
        }
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); margin: 0; padding: 20px; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 800px; margin: auto; background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        
        .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: bold; position: sticky; top: 0; background: white; z-index: 100; padding-top: 10px;}
        #timer { color: var(--error); font-size: 1.2rem; }
        
        /* Estilos del Menú por bloques */
        .subject-block { background: #fdfdfd; border: 2px solid #e1e8ed; border-radius: 12px; padding: 25px; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); }
        .subject-title { color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--secondary); text-align: left; }
        .topics-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        
        .menu-btn { background: var(--secondary); color: white; border: none; padding: 12px; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 8px; transition: 0.3s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .menu-btn:hover { background: #2980b9; transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .menu-btn.failed { background: #e67e22; width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .menu-btn.failed:hover { background: #d35400; }
        .btn-danger { background: var(--error); width: auto; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 8px 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .btn-danger:hover { background: #c0392b; }
        
        /* Tarjetas de preguntas */
        .question-block { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e1e8ed; border-radius: 10px; padding: 25px; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
        .question-text { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        
        .options-container { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .option-btn { padding: 15px; border: 2px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; background: white; text-align: left; font-size: 1.05rem; }
        .option-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #f8f9fa; border-color: var(--secondary); }
        
        /* Estados de Validación */
        .correct { background-color: var(--success) !important; color: white; border-color: var(--success); font-weight: bold; }
        .wrong { background-color: var(--error) !important; color: white; border-color: var(--error); }
        .translation-box { background-color: #e8f4fd !important; border-left: 5px solid var(--secondary) !important; color: #2c3e50; cursor: default; font-weight: normal; }

        .btn-main { padding: 12px 25px; background: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: bold; transition: 0.3s; width: 100%; margin-top: 25px; }
        .btn-main:hover { background: #1a252f; }
        .back-btn { padding: 6px 12px; border: none; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--secondary); color: white; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; margin-right: 10px; }
        
        .result-panel { background: #fff; border: 2px solid #eee; padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; display: none; }
        
        /* Base genérica para los futuros desplegables */
        .select-aptis-generic { padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 2px solid var(--secondary); font-size: 1rem; width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <!-- PANTALLA PRINCIPAL: MENÚ DE SECCIONES -->
    <div id="login-section">
        <h1 style="color: var(--primary); text-align: center;">PREPARACIÓN APTIS</h1>
        <p style="text-align: center;">Selecciona el bloque y la unidad que deseas practicar para comenzar.</p>
        
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <button class="menu-btn btn-danger" onclick="resetProgress()">🗑️ Borrar mi progreso</button>
            <button class="menu-btn failed" onclick="startFailedQuestionsTest()">
                ❌ Repasar mis fallos (<span id="failed-count">0</span>)
            </button>
        </div>
        
        <div id="subjects-container" style="margin-top: 30px;"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- PANTALLA DE TEST -->
    <div id="test-section" style="display:none;">
        <div class="header-info">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
                <button onclick="goBackToMenu()" class="back-btn">固 Volver</button>
                <div>📚 <span id="display-topic"></span></div>
            </div>
            <div id="timer">⏱️ 00:00</div>
        </div>
        
        <div id="questions-list"></div>
        
        <button id="finish-btn" class="btn-main" onclick="finishTest()">Finalizar Test ➔</button>
    </div>

    <!-- PANTALLA DE RESULTADOS -->
    <div id="results-section" class="result-panel">
        <h2 style="color: var(--primary);">¡Test Finalizado! 🎉</h2>
        <h3 id="score-text" style="font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--primary); margin: 15px 0;">0/0</h3>
        <p id="results-detail-text" style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 30px;"></p>
        <button class="btn-main" onclick="goBackToMenu()">↻ Volver al Menú Principal</button>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
   
    const misPreguntas = [
// =========================================================================
// VOCABULARIO - UNIT 1: HOUSE (TODAS LAS PALABRAS DE LAS IMÁGENES)
// =========================================================================
{
    m: "VOCABULARIO", t: "Unit 1: House", u: "TEST 1",
    p: "We need a comfortable _______ for the living room so I can sit and read books.",
    r: ["armchair", "balcony", "bookshelf", "ceiling"],
    c: "armchair",
    e: "Traducción: a) sillón | b) balcón | c) biblioteca/estante | d) techo"
},
{
    m: "VOCABULARIO", t: "Unit 1: House", u: "TEST 1",
    p: "Our apartment has a small _______ where we can grow some plants and look at the street.",
    r: ["bathroom", "bedroom", "balcony", "corridor"],
    c: "balcony",
    e: "Traducción: a) baño | b) dormitorio | c) balcón | d) pasillo"
},
{
    m: "VOCABULARIO", t: "Unit 1: House", u: "TEST 1",
    p: "After a long day at work, I love relaxing in a hot filled with water.",
    r: ["bell", "bin", "bath", "blanket"],
    c: "bath",
    e: "Traducción: a) timbre/campana | b) cubo | c) bañera | d) manta"
},
{
    m: "VOCABULARIO", t: "Unit 1: House", u: "TEST 1",
    p: "Don't forget to wash your hands in the _______ before dinner.",
    r: ["bathroom", "bedroom", "kitchen", "garage"],
    c: "bathroom",
    e: "Traducción: a) baño | b) dormitorio | c) cocina | d) cochera"
},
{
    m: "VOCABULARIO", t: "Unit 1: House", u: "TEST 1",
    p: "The children are sleeping upstairs in their _______.",
    r: ["livingroom", "hall", "bedroom", "garage"],
    c: "bedroom",
    e: "Traducción: a) salón | b) entrada/recibidor | c) dormitorio | d) cochera"
},
{
    m: "VOCABULARIO", t: "Unit 1: House", u: "TEST 1",
    p: "I didn't hear the front door _______ because I was listening to loud music.",
    r: ["bulb", "blind", "bell", "cooker"],
    c: "bell",
    e: "Traducción: a) bombilla | b) persiana | c) timbre/campana | d) fuegos de la cocina"
},
{
    m: "VOCABULARIO", t: "Unit 1: House", u: "TEST 1",
    p: "Please throw that empty plastic bottle into the rubbish _______.",
    r: ["chest of drawers", "bin", "cupboard", "chimney"],
    c: "bin",
    e: "Traducción: a) cómoda | b) cubo | c) armario de cosas | d) chimenea"
},
{
    m: "VOCABULARIO", t: "Unit 1: House", u: "TEST 1",
    p: "It's freezing tonight, so you will need a thick _______ on your bed.",
    r: ["cushion", "curtain", "blanket", "sheet"],
    c: "blanket",
    e: "Traducción: a) cojín | b) cortina | c) manta | d) sábana"
},
{
    m: "VOCABULARIO", t: "Unit 1: House", u: "TEST 1",
